# Testing

- Add tests for new business logic and pricing/auth/payment-critical paths
- Prefer fast unit tests for pure functions; integration tests for API + DB when available
- Do not merge knowingly broken tests
- Name tests by behavior, not implementation trivia
- When the project has no runner yet, note it in intake and avoid fake coverage theater
